# ======================================================================
# STEP 14 — COMPREHENSIVE DSB-ASSOCIATED GENE-LEVEL ANALYSIS
# ======================================================================
#
# OBJECTIVE
# ---------
# Define a PRE-SPECIFIED DSB-associated gene universe as the UNION of:
#
#   1. REACTOME HOMOLOGOUS RECOMBINATION REPAIR
#   2. REACTOME NONHOMOLOGOUS END JOINING (NHEJ)
#   3. REACTOME DOUBLE-STRAND BREAK REPAIR
#
# Genes are NOT forced into mutually exclusive categories.
#
# PRIMARY ANALYSIS:
#   Lipid score vs individual DSB-associated gene expression
#
# SECONDARY ANALYSIS:
#   Lipid-high vs lipid-low gene expression
#
# VALIDATION:
#   Repeat in GSE76427
#
# FINAL:
#   Identify genes significantly and directionally concordant
#   in both TCGA and GSE76427.
#
# IMPORTANT:
#   GSE14520 is NOT included.
#
# KEY CORRECTION FROM PREVIOUS VERSION:
#   TCGA STAR counts use ENSEMBL gene IDs.
#   Reactome GMT files use HGNC SYMBOLS.
#   Therefore:
#
#       ENSEMBL ID
#            ↓
#       HGNC SYMBOL
#            ↓
#       DSB gene matching
#
# ======================================================================


